<title>SINGAPORE: Asean Supreme Fund suspends share trade.</title>
<headline>Asean Supreme Fund suspends share trade.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asean Supreme Fund Ltd said on Friday it had asked for a suspension of trading in its shares on the Singapore Stock Exchange (SES) on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it wanted the suspension pending announcement of the half-year results and had asked that trade resume on Tuesday, January 21.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870 3088)</p>
</text>
